<!--
  The themed-icon layer, which Android tints itself.

  One flat silhouette and no shading, because the system paints every path a
  single colour: anything drawn as a lighter shade here would simply disappear
  into its neighbour. What survives is the outline of the device, the hinge as a
  gap, and the crescent as a hole in the top screen.
-->
